{"name":"Wardrobes around a chimney breast, Palmers Green (standard sizes)","source":"Built in Trimble SketchUp through the connector (9 Oct 2026) from the job photos at standard sizes (Raf: 'If you don't know use standard size'; nothing measured): ceiling 2600; in each alcove an IKEA PAX frame 1000 x 580 x 2012 (white, hardboard back) with a 500 mm unit of four wire baskets on the left and a hanging rail, and an 18 mm MDF top box (with back) up to the ceiling; MDF end panels to the ceiling at both ends; chimney breast 1350 wide and 380 deep; the bridge: 150 mm MDF stiles and head round the chimney breast with returns and a soffit back to it, and a 200 mm deep top box over it with a divider. Flat 18 mm MDF doors with 3 mm gaps (two tall and two top doors on each side, two top doors in the middle), round wooden knobs where the pairs meet. Back wall, blue chimney breast, white fireplace opening and hearth are room context. No dimension lines. Read back face by face; units mm, X along the wall, Y out from the room, Z up.","materials":{"MDF 18 mm":{"color":[200,172,142],"roughness":0.85},"PAX white":{"color":[242,242,238],"roughness":0.6},"Hardboard back":{"color":[236,236,232],"roughness":0.8},"Wire basket":{"color":[222,224,226],"roughness":0.4,"metalness":0.5},"Rail":{"color":[190,193,197],"roughness":0.35,"metalness":0.7},"Knob, wood":{"color":[214,186,148],"roughness":0.6},"Wall":{"color":[236,234,228],"roughness":0.95},"Room: blue paint":{"color":[98,124,140],"roughness":0.9},"Room: white paint":{"color":[240,240,236],"roughness":0.9},"Room: hearth":{"color":[92,94,96],"roughness":0.9}},"moves":{"Left wardrobe: Door, left (hinged left)":{"hinge":{"origin":[19.5,-600,0],"axis":[0,0,-1],"angle":100},"at":[0.0,0.4],"with":["Left wardrobe: Knob, left door"]},"Left wardrobe: Door, right (hinged right)":{"hinge":{"origin":[1016.5,-600,0],"axis":[0,0,1],"angle":95},"at":[0.05,0.45],"with":["Left wardrobe: Knob, right door"]},"Left wardrobe: Top door, left (hinged left)":